<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Luxury Beauty | Salon de Înfrumusețare Timișoara</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #121212;
            --bg-card: #1e1e1e;
            --accent-gold: #c5a059;
            --accent-gold-hover: #e0b86c;
            --text-light: #f5f5f5;
            --text-muted: #a0a0a0;
            --font-title: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            --font-body: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-family: var(--font-body);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.2);
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 1rem 5%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 2rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .hero {
            height: 90vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 1rem;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.7), rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.9)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560066984-138dadb4c035?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80') center/cover;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .rating-badge {
            background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-gold);
            padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .btn {
            background-color: var(--accent-gold);
            color: #000;
            padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-gold-hover);
        }

        section {
            padding: 5rem 5%;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            text-align: center;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            width: 60px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--accent-gold);
            margin: 0.8rem auto 0;
        }

        .services-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .service-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .service-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .service-card h3 {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .reviews-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .review-card {
            background-color: var(--bg-card);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .stars {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .review-author {
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: var(--accent-gold);
        }

        .contact-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .info-item {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .info-item h4 {
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .info-item p, .info-item a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .info-item a:hover {
            color: var(--text-light);
        }

        .landmark-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent-gold);
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            nav { display: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <a href="#" class="logo">LUXURY BEAUTY</a>
        <nav>
            <a href="#despre">Despre Noi</a>
            <a href="#servicii">Servicii</a>
            <a href="#recenzii">Recenzii</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <a href="tel:+40770414917" class="btn">Sună Acum</a>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="rating-badge">
            ★ 4.8 / 5 din 23 de recenzii Google
        </div>
        <h1>Luxury Beauty Timișoara</h1>
        <p>Experiențe premium de stilizare, tunsoare și îngrijire personalizată situat lângă Parcul Lidia.</p>
        <a href="tel:+40770414917" class="btn">Programează-te: 0770 414 917</a>
    </section>

    <section id="servicii">
        <h2 class="section-title">Servicii Premium</h2>
        <div class="services-grid">
            <div class="service-card">
                <h3>Coafură & Tunsoare Damă</h3>
                <p>Consultanță de stil și tunsori moderne realizate de stilistul nostru Iuliana.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <h3>Frizerie & Styling Masculin</h3>
                <p>Servicii de frizerie executate cu profesionalism maxim pentru un look impecabil.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card">
                <h3>Masaj Capilar & Îngrijire</h3>
                <p>Experiență relaxantă cu masaj capilar la spălare și produse profesionale.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="recenzii">
        <h2 class="section-title">Ce Spun Clienții Nostri</h2>
        <div class="reviews-grid">
            <div class="review-card">
                <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                <p>„Foarte mulțumit de serviciile domnului frizer. Profesionalism maxim. Recomand cu încredere.”</p>
                <div class="review-author">- Andrei C.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="review-card">
                <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                <p>„Iuliana este foarte pricepută! M-a tuns exact cum am vrut. Când mi-a spălat părul mi-a făcut masaj ❤️. Este sociabilă, prețul a fost decent. Cu siguranță revin!”</p>
                <div class="review-author">- Simona Sicoe</div>
            </div>
            <div class="review-card">
                <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
                <p>„Experiența a fost uimitoare, Iuliana este de milioane, tunsoare superbă, mână fină, conversație excelentă. Salonul pe interior arată superb.”</p>
                <div class="review-author">- Florina Titerlea</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Informații & Locație</h2>
        <div class="contact-container">
            <div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <h4>Adresă</h4>
                    <p>Strada Martir Ioan Stanciu 6, 300719 Timișoara</p>
                    <div class="landmark-badge">📍 Reper: Chiar lângă Parcul Lidia (zona Str. Mareșal Constantin Prezan / Aleea Cristalului)</div>
                    <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><small>Plus Code: P6MR+P3 Timișoara</small></p>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <h4>Telefon & Programări</h4>
                    <p><a href="tel:+40770414917">0770 414 917</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <h4>Program</h4>
                    <p>Luni – Vineri: 09:00 – 18:00<br>Sâmbătă: 09:00 – 16:00<br>Duminică: Închis</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <iframe 
                    src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Luxury+Beauty,+Strada+Martir+Ioan+Stanciu+6,+Timisoara&t=&z=16&ie=UTF8&iwloc=&output=embed" 
                    width="100%" 
                    height="320" 
                    style="border:0; border-radius: 8px;" 
                    allowfullscreen="" 
                    loading="lazy">
                </iframe>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Luxury Beauty Timișoara. Toate drepturile rezervate.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
